  "summary": "A ClickFix campaign that abuses attacker-created ChatGPT Custom GPTs (\"Plus 5.6\") and Google Sites pages to trick victims into pasting a PowerShell one-liner, which silently installs a malicious MSI (ISOSimple.msi). The MSI DLL-sideloads a patched Canon (or, in V2, Stardock) DLL that runs an encrypted loader hidden in a .wav/NuGet carrier and unpacks an encrypted virtual file system holding persistence scripts plus a full-featured RAT. Persistence is established through an HKCU Run value and a scheduled task sharing the same name, which are re-created if deleted.",
